{"term": "Phospholipid Bilayer", "fact": "two layers of phospholipid molecules"}
{"term": "Integral proteins", "fact": "span the whole membrane"}
{"term": "Peripheral proteins", "fact": "sit on the membrane surface"}
{"term": "Diffusion", "fact": "movement from high to low concentration"}
{"term": "Osmosis", "fact": "diffusion of water across a membrane"}
{"term": "Active transport", "fact": "uses energy to move molecules against a gradient"}
